; Pen plotter G-code generated by dxf_to_gcode.py
; pen up Z=25.0  pen down Z=20.0  draw F=2000  travel F=6000
G21 ; millimetres
G90 ; absolute positioning
M104 S0 ; hotend off
M140 S0 ; bed off
M107 ; fan off
G28 ; home all axes (Z uses the probe, so the bed centre is probed)
G0 Z25.0 F1500 ; pen up
G0 X0.000 Y0.000 F6000 ; front-left corner for setup
G1 Z20.0 F1500 ; pen down so you can check the height
M0 Adjust speed and Z height, then click to start
G0 Z25.0 F1500 ; pen up
G0 X0.000 Y0.000 F6000
G1 Z20.0 F1500
F2000
G1 X290.000 Y0.000
G1 X290.000 Y300.000
G1 X0.000 Y300.000
G1 X0.000 Y0.000
G0 Z25.0 F1500 ; pen up
G0 X0 Y280 F6000 ; park out of the way
M104 S0 ; hotend off
M140 S0 ; bed off
M107 ; fan off
M84 ; motors off
